      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So, I also got hit by this bug, however turning OSC ON/OFF will just make sync for one frame, and turning OFF OSC and rejoining won't make a difference.\nHOWEVER, switching to a non-humanoid avatar will get you position sync back (but no IK, since you're not a humanoid anymore).\nThis is a very weird bug, I thought it was only related to index controllers, but others people with Index controllers have no issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
