  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-02-28T19:34:52.342Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "this world causes you to be stuck immediately as you join and have OSC enabled\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_323e9cea-1f83-45d9-8a1d-c7a9e50ee191&instanceId=41651~hidden(usr_259294ba-b773-4531-9971-ef1c5aa3d385)~region(eu)~nonce(3A37DB812123F524C1CE9B1B60265BAC57268A5A26038C53)\nPlayer with OSC enabled just stays at spawn forever for other players, IK and position sync doesn't work. Tested with multiple people, as soon as you enable OSC, position and IK stops being synced. Voice still works.\n\nTo get IK and position sync back you need to turn off OSC and rejoin the world.",
